   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 0a 00}Tell me, {01 00 00 0a 00}what\ndo you really think of my\n{0b 02 00}{04 1b 00}?\n{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}gave it to me.\nPretty nice, isn't it?\n\n{07 0a 00}Let me tell you,{01 00 00 05 00} it's SO\nCOOL to have friends with\nstyle, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}! {01 00 00 0a 00}Ütle, {01 00 00 0a 00}mida\nsa tegelikult arvad minu\n{0b 02 00}{04 1b 00} kohta?\n{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}kinkis selle mulle.\nPäris kena, kas pole?\n\n{07 0a 00}Ütlen sulle,{01 00 00 05 00} on NII LAHE\nomada sõpru, kellel on\nstiili, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!"
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "en": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00} Check out {01 00 00 05 00}this\noutfit, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}gave it\nto me. {01 00 00 05 00}{07 0d 00}I'm, like, a mile\nahead of the fashion crowd.\n{07 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}is\nscoring major points in my\nbook!",
   "et": "{07 14 00}{0b 03 00}{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 0a 00} Vaata {01 00 00 05 00}seda\nrõivast, {01 00 00 05 00}{04 02 00}!\n\n{07 00 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}kinkis selle\nmulle. {01 00 00 05 00}{07 0d 00}Olen, nagu, terve\nmiili moerahvast ees.\n{07 0a 00}{0b 03 00}{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00} {ff 00 00 00}kogub\nminu silmis tõsiseid\npunkte!"
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "en": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Hi there{01 07 00},{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 14 00}Nice timing!\n\nLook at my totally rockin'\n{0b 02 00}{04 1b 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nIs it sweet or what!\n{07 0d 00}To tell the truth,{01 00 00 05 00}\nit's a present from\n{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00}{ff 00 00 00}!\n{07 00 00}Oh, {01 00 00 05 00}but {01 00 00 05 00}that doesn't mean\nI'm going to ask you for\nanything{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Really!",
   "et": "{0b 03 00}{01 06 00}Tere{01 07 00},{01 00 00 0a 00}\n{04 1f 00}!{01 00 00 05 00} {07 14 00}Hea ajastus!\n\nVaata mu täiesti vägevat\n{0b 02 00}{04 1b 00}!{01 00 00 05 00}\nKas pole magus!\n{07 0d 00}Ausalt öeldes,{01 00 00 05 00}\nsee on kingitus\n{ff 00 00 05}{04 14 00}{ff 00 00 00} käest!\n{07 00 00}Oi, {01 00 00 05 00}aga {01 00 00 05 00}see ei tähenda,\net ma sinult midagi\nküsima hakkan{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00}.{01 00 00 05 00} Tõesti!"
